---
import ArticlePageLayout from '../../layouts/ArticlePageLayout.astro';

const toc = [
  { id: 'como-usar', label: 'Como usar a calculadora' },
  { id: 'ferramenta', label: 'Calculadora interativa' },
  { id: 'formula', label: 'Formula de calculo' },
  { id: 'exemplo', label: 'Exemplo completo' },
  { id: 'aviso', label: 'Aviso importante' },
];
---

<ArticlePageLayout
  title="Calculadora de Horas Extras 6x1 | Escala6x1.net"
  heading="Calculadora de Horas Extras para Escala 6x1"
  description="Ferramenta gratuita para estimar pagamento de horas extras na jornada 6x1 com adicional de 50% e 100%, incluindo domingos e feriados."
  canonicalPath="/calculadora-horas-extras-6x1/"
  readTime="8 min"
  toc={toc}
>
  <p>
    Esta calculadora ajuda a estimar o valor mensal de horas extras na escala 6x1. E util para revisao rapida de
    folha, negociacao interna e controle pessoal da jornada.
  </p>

  <h2 id="como-usar" class="font-display text-2xl text-white mt-10">Como usar a calculadora</h2>
  <ol class="list-decimal pl-6 space-y-2">
    <li>Informe seu salario mensal bruto.</li>
    <li>Defina quantas horas extras comuns voce fez no mes.</li>
    <li>Defina quantas horas extras voce fez em domingos ou feriados.</li>
    <li>Clique em "Calcular" para ver a estimativa.</li>
  </ol>

  <h2 id="ferramenta" class="font-display text-2xl text-white mt-10">Calculadora interativa</h2>
  <section class="rounded-2xl border border-ink-700/50 bg-ink-900/50 p-6">
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
      <label class="text-sm">
        <span class="block text-ink-300 mb-2">Salario mensal (R$)</span>
        <input id="salary" type="number" min="0" step="0.01" class="w-full rounded-lg border border-ink-700 bg-ink-950 px-3 py-2 text-white" value="2800" />
      </label>
      <label class="text-sm">
        <span class="block text-ink-300 mb-2">Horas extras normais (50%)</span>
        <input id="extra50" type="number" min="0" step="0.1" class="w-full rounded-lg border border-ink-700 bg-ink-950 px-3 py-2 text-white" value="12" />
      </label>
      <label class="text-sm">
        <span class="block text-ink-300 mb-2">Horas em domingo/feriado (100%)</span>
        <input id="extra100" type="number" min="0" step="0.1" class="w-full rounded-lg border border-ink-700 bg-ink-950 px-3 py-2 text-white" value="4" />
      </label>
      <label class="text-sm">
        <span class="block text-ink-300 mb-2">Horas base mensais</span>
        <input id="baseHours" type="number" min="1" step="1" class="w-full rounded-lg border border-ink-700 bg-ink-950 px-3 py-2 text-white" value="220" />
      </label>
    </div>

    <button
      id="calcButton"
      class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 bg-brand-500 hover:bg-brand-400 text-white font-semibold px-6 py-3 rounded-xl transition-colors"
      type="button"
    >
      Calcular
    </button>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-3 mt-6 text-sm">
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-ink-700/50 bg-ink-950/70 p-4">
        <p class="text-ink-400">Valor da hora base</p>
        <p id="hourValue" class="text-white text-xl font-semibold mt-1">R$ 0.00</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-ink-700/50 bg-ink-950/70 p-4">
        <p class="text-ink-400">Total horas 50%</p>
        <p id="total50" class="text-white text-xl font-semibold mt-1">R$ 0.00</p>
      </div>
      <div class="rounded-xl border border-ink-700/50 bg-ink-950/70 p-4">
        <p class="text-ink-400">Total horas 100%</p>
        <p id="total100" class="text-white text-xl font-semibold mt-1">R$ 0.00</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="rounded-xl border border-sage-500/30 bg-sage-500/10 p-4 mt-4">
      <p class="text-sm text-sage-300">Estimativa total de extras no mes</p>
      <p id="grandTotal" class="text-2xl font-semibold text-white">R$ 0.00</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <h2 id="formula" class="font-display text-2xl text-white mt-10">Formula de calculo</h2>
  <p>A logica aplicada nesta ferramenta e:</p>
  <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
    <li>Valor da hora base = salario mensal / horas base do mes.</li>
    <li>Hora extra 50% = valor da hora base x 1.5.</li>
    <li>Hora extra 100% = valor da hora base x 2.</li>
    <li>Total = (horas 50% x hora 50%) + (horas 100% x hora 100%).</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 id="exemplo" class="font-display text-2xl text-white mt-10">Exemplo completo</h2>
  <p>
    Se o salario for R$ 2.800 e a base mensal for 220 horas, o valor da hora base e R$ 12,73. Com 12 horas extra
    a 50% e 4 horas a 100%, a estimativa e:
  </p>
  <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
    <li>12 x (12,73 x 1,5) = R$ 229,14</li>
    <li>4 x (12,73 x 2) = R$ 101,84</li>
    <li>Total estimado = R$ 330,98</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 id="aviso" class="font-display text-2xl text-white mt-10">Aviso importante</h2>
  <p>
    Esta calculadora oferece estimativa educacional. Convencoes coletivas, adicionais especificos e regras de
    compensacao podem alterar o resultado final.
  </p>
  <p>
    Para contexto legal e operacional complementar, consulte o
    <a href="/guia-escala-6x1/" class="text-brand-400 hover:text-brand-300">guia completo da escala 6x1</a>
    e a pagina de
    <a href="/derechos-laborales-escala-6x1/" class="text-brand-400 hover:text-brand-300">direitos trabalhistas</a>.
  </p>

  <script is:inline>
    function formatBRL(value) {
      return value.toLocaleString('pt-BR', { style: 'currency', currency: 'BRL' });
    }

    function calculateExtras() {
      const salary = Number(document.getElementById('salary')?.value || 0);
      const extra50 = Number(document.getElementById('extra50')?.value || 0);
      const extra100 = Number(document.getElementById('extra100')?.value || 0);
      const baseHours = Number(document.getElementById('baseHours')?.value || 220);

      if (baseHours <= 0) {
        return;
      }

      const hourValue = salary / baseHours;
      const total50 = extra50 * hourValue * 1.5;
      const total100 = extra100 * hourValue * 2;
      const grandTotal = total50 + total100;

      const hourValueEl = document.getElementById('hourValue');
      const total50El = document.getElementById('total50');
      const total100El = document.getElementById('total100');
      const grandTotalEl = document.getElementById('grandTotal');

      if (hourValueEl) hourValueEl.textContent = formatBRL(hourValue);
      if (total50El) total50El.textContent = formatBRL(total50);
      if (total100El) total100El.textContent = formatBRL(total100);
      if (grandTotalEl) grandTotalEl.textContent = formatBRL(grandTotal);
    }

    const calcButton = document.getElementById('calcButton');
    if (calcButton) {
      calcButton.addEventListener('click', calculateExtras);
    }

    calculateExtras();
  </script>
</ArticlePageLayout>
